    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Deep under the ground, it's so hot that some rock melts into a thick, gooey liquid called magma.",
      "punch": "magma",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🔥",
        "text": "Melted rock: magma",
        "cue": "magma",
        "sub": "Deep underground",
        "sub_cue": "deep"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Melted rock? Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Magma is lighter than the solid rock around it, so it slowly rises up, like a bubble in honey.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🍯",
        "text": "Magma rises up",
        "cue": "rises",
        "sub": "Like a bubble in honey",
        "sub_cue": "bubble"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Then what happens?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "It collects in a big pocket called a magma chamber. Gases in the magma push harder and harder, like a shaken-up fizzy drink.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "Inside a volcano",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Magma chamber",
            "icon": "🕳️",
            "cue": "chamber"
          },
          {
            "label": "Gases push",
            "icon": "💨",
            "cue": "gases"
          },
          {
            "label": "Like a fizzy drink",
            "icon": "🥤",
            "cue": "fizzy"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "And then it bursts out?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Yes! The magma bursts out of the top. Once it's outside, we call it lava.",
      "punch": "lava",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "Underground",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Magma",
