          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lava river",
              "icon": "🟠",
              "cue": "river"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Is lava good for anything?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Yes! When lava cools, it turns into new rock. Some islands were made by volcanoes, layer by layer!",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🏝️",
